# The moving case. No golden — this scene is deliberately non-deterministic; what it
# asserts is that the machinery that MOVES still moves. Both the geometry clock
# (rot_mod_* integrated per frame) and the auto-orbit camera are driven here, so a
# frozen clock, a wedged camera, or a redraw loop that stopped advancing all fail.
#!desc     Rotation + auto-orbit camera running — proves the clock still turns.
#!checks   nonblack,animates
#!settle   900

generator "organic math"
surface original
material standard

set rot_mod_x 0.4 rot_mod_y 0.25 rot_mod_z 0.0
set rot_amp_x 0.3 rot_amp_y 0.3 rot_amp_z 0.0
set cam_path 1 cam_speed 0.25 cam_kick 0.3

set exposure 0 metallic 0.2 roughness 0.5
set ambient 0.3 glow 0.25 bloom_intensity 0.25
